  "id": "grafted",
  "lore": "*\"My mother says I was a quiet baby. That's because my lungs were failing. Then they gave me the first ones.\"*\n\nThe Grafted are a people whose flesh can't live on its own. Every Grafted child is born whole and healthy, and within a few years the body starts to fail: the skin greys, the breath shortens, the heart stumbles. They call it **the Greying**. The only cure anyone knows is to replace what fails with machinery, piece by piece, from early childhood until death. A Grafted adult is part flesh and part numenera, and the two can't be separated: take out the core and the person dies within the hour.\n\nThey call themselves **the Mended**. \"Grafted\" is what everyone else calls them, and most of them have stopped correcting it.",
